image.prompt:
Create a new image from the following brief.

Task: generate one coherent image that satisfies every requirement below.
Main subject: {subject}
Position and scale: {subject_position}. {subject_scale}
Spatial relationships: {spatial}. {spatial_relationships}
Scene: {scene}
Composition and camera: {composition}. {shot_type}. {camera_angle}
Visual style: {style}. Lighting: {lighting}. Color: {color}. Material: {material}.
Text in image: {text_content}
Avoid: {negative_words}
Aspect ratio: {aspect_ratio}
Constraints: keep proportions, perspective, lighting direction and color temperature consistent across all elements; preserve a clear visual hierarchy; do not add elements that are not described above.

image.recreate:
Recreate the provided reference image as faithfully as possible.

Task: high-fidelity recreation of the reference image, not a loose interpretation.
Main subject: {subject}
Position and scale: {subject_position}. {subject_scale}
Spatial relationships: {spatial}. {spatial_relationships}
Scene: {scene}
Composition and camera: {composition}. {shot_type}. {camera_angle}
Visual style: {style}. Lighting: {lighting}. Color: {color}. Material: {material}.
Preserve exactly: {preserve_constraints}
Avoid changing: {forbidden_changes}
Constraints: do not invent details that are not visible in the reference; do not restyle the image; keep the original proportions, perspective, existing text and spatial relationships. Exact pixel-level identity is not guaranteed, but the visual structure must remain recognizably the same.

image.edit:
Edit the provided image.

Requested changes: {target_changes}
Change: {target_style}
Modification scope: {modification_scope}
Preserve unchanged: {preserve_constraints}
Do not change: {forbidden_changes}
Constraints: apply only the requested change; keep the identity, facial features, expression, body pose, body proportions, camera framing, lighting, color and existing text unchanged unless explicitly listed above.

